Scope. This licence covers the code (src/, tools/, tests/, reference/) and the
simulated benchmark data and metadata produced by it (Parquet episodes, cards,
manifests). It does NOT cover the real-data tracks (battery_pf, battery_lg,
calce, emps, silverbox, neurobem, bmw_i3): those are fetched from their original
hosts and remain under their providers' own terms, stated on each track's card.
